MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hello,

I noticed that when I run the simplest mapreduce function, there is a initial wait of several minutes where the R cursor disappears. Then appears: "packageJobJar: [/tmp/RtmppdDSX0..." and the map phase starts.
I wonder why there is such big initial wait. Is it due to the compilation JAR with mapreduce? Is it due to hadoop?
Is there something I can do for minimizing it?

Thanks,
Rui

